  "steps": [
    "Blend the chipotle sauce ingredients until creamy and refrigerate.",
    "Rinse the rice until the water runs mostly clear, then add it to a rice cooker with the water, bouillon, oil and spices and cook on the white rice setting. Fluff before serving.",
    "Slice the steak against the grain, toss with the dry seasonings, and sear in a little oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Whisk the steak sauce ingredients, pour over the steak, and simmer gently until cooked through and lightly thickened. Add water if needed.",
    "Warm a tortilla until flexible, then layer rice, steak, nacho cheese, chipotle sauce, tortilla strips and sour cream.",
    "Fold in the sides and roll tightly, then toast seam-side down in a skillet to seal.",
    "Line a nonstick skillet with parchment, sprinkle on shredded cheese, and set the burrito on top, untoasted side down. Cook over medium-low until the cheese is melted and golden.",
    "Lift out with the parchment, wrap, and let it cool a minute so the cheese sets on the outside."
  ],
